m/p/DB9e0h-ynwO","post_user_id":"5a0a4cb0edc2953fe5ca9bb8","channel":"instagram","author":"justintimberlake","created_at":"2024-11-04T19:09:05","title":"A once in a lifetime artist. His list of accolades goes on and on. The example of excellence at craft. A mentor to so many that have followed. Growing up listening to so many of his timeless works shaped so much of the music that I wanted to make or be a part of. The maestro behind so many of my favorite artists. And then, to take a journey myself into the world of being an artist and getting to be in his presence and spend time talking about music and life. There were so many bits of guidance he gave me along the way that I will take with me forever… to know so many of his family and to find out how amazing they all are as humans and artists themselves… a direct reflection of the love he gave… and the love he appreciated.\n\nI find myself with a heavy heart today. We lost someone so special. But, I also consider myself so fortunate to be here while he was and to experience his essence, dedication, and mastery.\n\nMy heart and sincerest condolences go out to all of the Jones family and friends. \n\nRIP, King. Your contribution will live on forever and ever. What a journey you have taken us all on.","image_url":"https://scontent-cdg4-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/465827785_18471175705014726_3791966293511088850_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_ohc=yDSwYSGevXEQ7kNvgF96Ql5&_nc_gid=b60348843340440581eac0f60dabbc56&edm=APU89FABAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzQ5NDA4NDQyNTM4NDk3OTMxNg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AYAkILb1tf2cKCvJulFTYFeG52iQQQ4iWDF9IxkKeUGlWw&oe=677F0920&_nc_sid=bc0c2c","avatar":"https://instagram.ftrn5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-19/420637630_317483831293229_52799959493669486_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.ftrn5-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=1&_nc_ohc=Od9pCZtDRPIQ7kNvgGYltox&_nc_gid=9d687d4b842e4bfaafa6b1b3a4ee87fc&edm=APs17CUBAAAA&ccb=7-